==English==

===Etymology===
A reference to [[w:Sing Sing|Sing Sing prison]], which is located on the [[w:Hudson River|Hudson river]], to the north of (and upstream from) [[w:New York City|New York City]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|En-au-up the river.ogg|a=AU}}

